  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ある　ちいきだけで　さいばいされるとくべつな　りんごで　しんかした。２ひきで　１ひきの　ポケモンなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어떤 지역에서만 재배되는 특별한 사과에 의해 진화했다. 두 마리가 하나인 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用只會在某個地區栽培的特別的蘋果進化而來。是２隻等於１隻的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est composé de deux individus. Il a évolué grâce à une pomme spéciale qui n’est cultivée que dans une certaine région.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon besteht aus zwei Individuen. Es hat sich mithilfe eines Apfels entwickelt, der nur in einer bestimmten Gegend angebaut wird.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha evolucionado gracias a una manzana especial que solo se cultiva en cierta zona. Este Pokémon está formado por dos individuos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pokémon formato da due individui. Si è evoluto grazie a un pomo speciale coltivato solo in una certa zona.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dipplin is two creatures in one Pokémon. Its evolution was triggered by a special apple grown only in one place.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ある　地域だけで　栽培される特別な　りんごで　進化した。２匹で　１匹の　ポケモンなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "以仅能在某地区栽培的特殊苹果进化而成。是２只为一体的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha evolucionado gracias a una manzana especial que solo se cultiva en cierta zona. Este Pokémon está formado por dos individuos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまを　だしている　そとッチュとしっぽを　だしている　なかッチュがたすけあい　りんごのなかで　くらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리를 내밀고 있는 외미르와 꼬리를 내밀고 있는 내미르가 사과 안에서 서로 도우며 지낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由露出了頭部的外頭蟲與露出了尾巴的裡頭蟲相扶相持，一起在蘋果裡面生活。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "À l’intérieur de la pomme vivent « Ver-dehors » et « Ver-dedans ». La tête du premier et la queue du second sortent du fruit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Apfel leben die sich gegenseitig helfenden „Kopfel“ und „Schwanzel“. Beim Ersten ragt der Kopf heraus, beim Zweiten der Schwanz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Exterappli, el que saca la cabeza, e Interappli, el que saca la cola, viven juntos dentro de la manzana y se ayudan el uno al otro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’Applitesta, che fa capolino, e l’Applicoda, di cui invece sbuca solo la parte posteriore, vivono nel pomo aiutandosi a vicenda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The head sticking out belongs to the fore-wyrm, while the tail belongs to the core-wyrm. The two share one apple and help each other out.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭を　出している　そとッチュと尻尾を　出している　なかッチュが助け合い　りんごのなかで　暮らす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "露出脑袋的外头虫与露出尾巴的里头虫互相帮助，一起生活在苹果里面。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
